{"book":"psalms","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-29T23:10:43.257651760Z","verse":18,"ref":"psalms 40:18","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":40,"translation":"But ⟨as for⟩ me — poor and needy ⟨am⟩ I; Adonai reckons for me. My help and my deliverer ⟨are⟩ you, my Elohim — do not delay!","tokens":[{"surface":"ואני","gloss":"But as for me"},{"surface":"עני","gloss":"poor"},{"surface":"ואביון","gloss":"and needy"},{"surface":"אדני","gloss":"Adonai"},{"surface":"יחשב","gloss":"reckons"},{"surface":"לי","gloss":"for me"},{"surface":"עזרתי","gloss":"my help"},{"surface":"ומפלטי","gloss":"and my deliverer"},{"surface":"אתה","gloss":"you"},{"surface":"אלהי","gloss":"my Elohim"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"do not"},{"surface":"תאחר","gloss":"delay"}]}